cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in work that you publish, please cite it."
title: "Rust DICOM Station"
abstract: >-
  DICOM and RT DICOM station for medical imaging and radiotherapy research,
  analysis and quality assurance, written entirely in Rust. CT, MR and PET
  series with RTSTRUCT, RTDOSE and RTPLAN; registration, structure
  propagation, DRR generation, dose-volume histograms, 4D motion analysis,
  interactive and AI-assisted segmentation, 3D visualization, DICOM editing
  and export.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Pryanichnikov
    given-names: Alexander
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"   # add your ORCID here
version: 0.9.1
date-released: 2026-09-14
url: "https://alexprotom.github.io/rust-dicom-station/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/alexprotom/rust-dicom-station"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - DICOM
  - medical imaging
  - radiotherapy
  - proton therapy
  - RTSTRUCT
  - dose-volume histogram
  - deformable image registration
  - segmentation
  - Rust
